.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD-LOGS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead-logs
.Nd tail the application log
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm egghead logs
.Op Fl n Ar lines
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Cm logs
tails the application log file at
.Pa $XDG_STATE_HOME/egghead/egghead.log
.Pq typically Pa ~/.local/state/egghead/egghead.log .
Run it in a separate terminal to watch the log while the TUI
holds the alt-screen, or while a service-supervised
.Cm egghead serve
runs in the background.
.Pp
The log routing depends on the command in use. The TUI and most
CLI commands write to the file; the
.Cm mcp
command also writes only to the file
.Pq standard output is the wire protocol ;
.Cm serve
writes both to the file and to standard output.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-n lines"
.It Fl n , Fl -lines Ar lines
Show this many lines initially before following. Default:
.Sy 10 .
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead logs
egghead logs -n 200
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr egghead-doctor 1 ,
.Xr egghead-service 1 ,
.Xr egghead-serve 1 ,
.Xr egghead 1
